message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it."
title: "Domain-calibrated machine learning and structure-based virtual screening of natural products against HCC kinases"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline that quantifies how far a conformal applicability
  domain calibrated on synthetic kinase inhibitors transfers to natural-product
  chemical space, with orthogonal structure-based validation.
